       "id": "37835445"
      }
     ],
     "value": "Forms homooligomers (PubMed:34524408). Interacts with MEP1B (PubMed:27180357). Interacts with integrin alpha3/ITGA3 (PubMed:25761241). Interacts with RICTOR and MTOR (PubMed:25761241, PubMed:35904232). Interacts with ADAM17 (PubMed:36078095). Interacts with ECE1 (PubMed:37835445)"
    }
